✨ Surah Quraysh (Surah no. 106, Makki Surah, 4 ayaat)

🌿 **Surah Quraysh ka Khaaka**

Allah Ta’ala ne is chhoti si surah mein **Quraysh qabeela** ko unki ni‘maton ki yaad dilayi hai aur unko sirf Allah ki ibadat ka hukm diya hai.

_____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

📌 **Ayah 1–2: Allah ki Rehmat Quraysh par**

✅*"Li-eelaafi Quraysh. Eelaafihim rihlata shitaaa’i wassaif."*

➡️ Allah ne Quraysh ko apni rehmat se **aapas mein ek dosti aur ittihad (unity)** ataa kiya.
➡️ Allah ne unke liye **sardi aur garmi dono mausamon ki safar (trade journeys)** aasaan banayi.

* Sardi ke mausam mein woh **Yemen** jaate the.
* Garmi ke mausam mein woh **Shaam (Syria)** jaate the.
  Yeh tijarati safar Quraysh ke liye **rizq ka zariya** bane aur unki izzat aur maqam Arab mein barh gaya.

_____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

📌 **Ayah 3: Allah ki Bandagi ka Hukm**

✅*"Falya‘budoo Rabba haazal-bait"*

➡️ Allah ne Quraysh ko yaad dilaya ke yeh **Ka‘aba ke Rab (Allah)** hi ki bandagi karein.
➡️ Jo unko izzat, tijarat aur hifazat deta hai.

_____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

📌 **Ayah 4: Allah ki Ni‘maton ka Zikr**

✅*"Allazeee at‘amahum min joo‘inw-wa-aamanahum min khawf."*

➡️ Allah ne Quraysh ko **bhookh se bachaya aur rizq diya**.
➡️ Allah ne unko **khauf aur asurak (insecurity)** se mehfooz rakha.
➡️ Jabke baaki Arab qabail hamesha jhagadte aur ladte rehte the.

_____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

 🌟 **Asal Paigham**

1. Quraysh ki izzat aur tijarat sirf **Allah ki den hai**.
2. Allah ne unki **zarooraton ko poora kiya**:

   * Rizq (food and trade)
   * Aman (security and respect)
3. In sab ni‘maton ke bawajood Quraysh ka farz tha ke woh **sirf Allah ki ibadat karein**, lekin woh shirk aur but-parasti mein lage rahe.

 📖 **Tafsir ki roshni mein sabaq**

* **Shukr**: Allah ki ni‘maton ka shukr ada karna sirf ibadat aur tawheed se hota hai.
* **Aman aur Rizq**: Dono Allah ke haath mein hain, is liye banda apni koshish ke saath sirf Allah par bharosa kare.
* **Ka‘aba ki Qadr**: Allah ne Quraysh ko Ka‘aba ka zimmedar banaya, is liye unka farz tha ke sabse pehle wohi tawheed ko apnaate.

_____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________

🔑 **Short Summary**:
Surah Quraysh ek **yaad-dihani** hai ke jis Allah ne Quraysh ko tijarat, rizq aur aman diya, unhe sirf usi ki ibadat karni chahiye thi — na ke but-parasti.

